   "y": 942,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 16384]  heads concatenated` — bar clipped (real 819px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "fo62",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2250,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**o_proj** 16384 → 5376  \n88.1M",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "fot63",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2266,
   "y": 1102,
   "width": 269,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl64",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2570,
   "y": 1092,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 5376]  → post-attention norm, as on the left`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-full",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2250,
   "y": 1166,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "**Proportional RoPE**: frequencies are laid out as if all 512 dims rotated, but only the first 64 frequency pairs are non-zero — 128 dims carry position, the other 384 are position-free.    \nKV cache per token: 2 × 4 × 512 = 4,096 values, for every past token. Attention weights: 187.2M vs 132.1M in a sliding layer."
  }
